export function renderGuide(heading){document.querySelector('#main').innerHTML=heading('Your writing workspace','Plan your argument, practise one useful skill, and write in your own words.')+`<section class="card"><h2>Start with My papers</h2><p>Choose your Obsidian vault, then open a paper folder or create a new paper. Each paper has a root outline linking its sections, subsections and arguments. Notes, reasoning and manuscript prose have separate fields and save automatically.</p><h2>Practise and return</h2><p>Use Courses &amp; progress for the included 120 English drills. Synced private packs and saved attempts appear when you connect your vault. Open an argument and choose Review or ask about my text to use your own writing with the local tutor.</p><h2>Mac and Windows</h2><p>Run the installation script once, then use the desktop shortcut. Start your existing Ollama application and select an installed model in Settings. The app does not require LM Studio.</p><p>Wait for Saved to your Obsidian vault, then let Obsidian Sync finish before switching devices. Compare &amp; recover preserves competing saved versions.</p><a class="btn" href="/api/guides/portable">Read the full setup and writing guide</a></section>`;}
